Third-party material
--------------------

Third-party material in this repository is not covered by this notice; it keeps its
own license, and its rights stay with its owners.

It includes:

- CC-CEDICT (`lib/cedict/`), by MDBG and contributors: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0, https://cc-cedict.org/wiki/
- cjk-decomp (`lib/cjk/`)
- cjkvi-ids (`lib/cjkvi/`), based on the CHISE IDS database: GNU General Public License v2, https://github.com/cjkvi/cjkvi-ids
- HSK word lists (`lib/hsk/`), from the syllabus by the Center for Language Education and Cooperation / Chinese Testing International
- Tatoeba sentences (`lib/sentences/`), by the Tatoeba contributors: Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France, https://tatoeba.org
- Unicode Unihan database (`lib/unihan/`), Unicode, Inc.: Unicode License, https://www.unicode.org/license.txt
- BCC corpus word frequencies (`lib/word_frequencies/`), Beijing Language and Culture University

Any other third-party material keeps its own license as stated in its source.
